  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS. ANKARA. FLYING BROOM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The meeting will be held in Cappadocia, Turkey, on 14&#x2013;15 November 2025, bringing together 60 women from 60 women&#x2019;s organizations across Turkey. The event aims to strengthen solidarity, discuss the current challenges of the women&#x2019;s movement, and develop new strategies for feminist organizing in a climate where women&#x2019;s rights are increasingly under threat. Key themes include preventing violence against women, combating femicide, defending existing legal rights, the future of feminism in times of crisis, and strengthening local women&#x2019;s organizations. The meeting will produce a comprehensive report to be disseminated among women&#x2019;s CSOs across Turkey to ensure sustainability and collective action.</narrative>
  </description>
